flowchart TD
    A([Start PTAS]) --> B[Connect to FastAPI readiness endpoint]
    B --> C[Register or log in]
    C --> D[Select or create project]
    D --> E[Create authorized scope rule]
    E --> F[Enter target inside scope]
    F --> G{Authorization confirmed?}

    G -->|No| STOP[Cancel without scanning]
    G -->|Yes| H{Include external CVE correlation?}
    H -->|No| I[Run QUICK and FULL Nmap stages]
    H -->|Yes| J[Run QUICK, FULL and VULNERABILITY Nmap stages]

    I --> K[Parse Nmap XML and persist findings]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Run installed bounded service-aware checks]
    L --> M[Add local Exploit-DB references when version evidence exists]
    M --> N[Load stored findings]

    N --> O{Local Ollama configured?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Generate evidence-based suggestions]
    O -->|No| Q[Store no recommendation and report Ollama unavailable]
    P --> R[Apply independent scope and command safety validation]
    R -->|Accepted| S[Persist as PENDING_APPROVAL]
    R -->|Rejected| Q

    S --> T[Display recommendation status and commands in read-only pane]
    Q --> T
    T --> ALL[Student requests recommendations for all uncovered findings]
    ALL --> BATCH[Generate small Ollama batches tied to exact finding IDs]
    BATCH --> CHECK[Validate exact target, tool, command safety and service port]
    CHECK -->|Accepted| S
    CHECK -->|Rejected or unavailable| SAFE[Keep finding uncovered and display safe failure]
    T --> U[Student manually runs an allowed command in left shell]
    U --> V[Sanitize and analyze completed terminal output]
    V --> W{New validated Ollama command available?}
    W -->|Yes| U
    W -->|No| SAFE

    S --> X{Exact registered Metasploitable 2 lab verified?}
    X -->|Yes| Y[Offer separate access-test command and confirmation gate]
    X -->|No| Z[Keep evidence-only recommendation policy]

    S --> AA[Run ptas report ID]
    SAFE --> AA
    AA --> AB[Generate scan-specific JSON and HTML report]
    AB --> PRINT[Optionally print HTML to PDF in browser]
    PRINT --> AC([End])

    NOTE[There is no static recommendation fallback.<br/>PTAS never automatically executes an AI-generated command.]
    NOTE -.-> Q
    NOTE -.-> CHECK
